"entity": {
"name": "Sylvamo Corporation",
"description": "Sylvamo Corp. operates as a paper company and manufactures uncoated freesheet for paper products, such as cut size and offset paper. It also markets pulp, aseptic and liquid packaging board, and coated unbleached kraft papers. The company operates through the following geographical segments: Europe, Latin America, and North America. The Europe segment produces a broad portfolio of uncoated freesheet papers for numerous uses and applications, and market pulp. The Latin America segment focuses on uncoated freesheet paper and market pulp in Brazil. The North America segment refers to the uncoated freesheet papers at its mills in Eastover, South Carolina and Ticonderoga, New York. Sylvamo was founded in 1898 and is headquartered in Memphis, TN.",
